'cell_type': 'markdown', 'id': '30734955', 'metadata': {}, 'source': '## 9. Export\n\nSave the prediction table and metadata. Bring these files back into the repository under `experiments/predictions/`.'}, {'cell_type': 'code', 'execution_count': 11, 'id': 'b84b969c', 'metadata': {'execution': {'iopub.execute_input': '2026-10-19T16:51:23.031474Z', 'iopub.status.busy': '2026-10-19T16:51:23.030960Z', 'iopub.status.idle': '2026-10-19T16:51:23.344540Z', 'shell.execute_reply': '2026-10-19T16:51:23.343376Z'}, 'trusted': False}, 'outputs': [{'data': {'text/plain': "('/content/New_Paper_MOE/experiments/predictions/gate1_doubtful_d1_decision_predictions.csv',\n '/content/New_Paper_MOE/experiments/predictions/gate1_doubtful_d1_runtime_metadata.json')"}, 'execution_count': 11, 'metadata': {}, 'output_type': 'execute_result'}], 'source': 'columns = ["domain", "family", "dga_type", "split", "y_true", "model", "p_wl", "p_dga", "latency_ms"]\npredictions[columns].to_csv(OUTPUT_CSV, index=False)\n\nmetadata = {\n    "seed": SEED,\n    "run_name": RUN_NAME,\n    "decision_model": DECISION_MODEL,\n    "model_revision": MODEL_REVISIONS[DECISION_MODEL],\n    "device": device,\n    "dtype": dtype_used,\n    "gpu": torch.cuda.get_device_name(0) if torch.cuda.is_available() else None,\n    "questions": QUESTIONS,\n    "runtime": runtime_info,\n    "torch": torch.__version__,\n    "num_input_domains": int(len(domains)),\n    "num_output_rows": int(len(predictions)),\n    "output_csv": str(OUTPUT_CSV),\n}\nRUN_METADATA_JSON.write_text(json.dumps(metadata, indent=2), encoding="utf-8")\nstr(OUTPUT_CSV), str(RUN_METADATA_JSON)'}, {'cell_type': 'markdown', 'id': '5da986a1', 'metadata': {}, 'source': '## 10. Next Steps\n\nAfter exporting from Colab:\n\n- download `<run>_<model>_decision_predictions.csv` and `<run>_<model>_runtime_metadata.json`;\n- place both files in `experiments/predictions/` in this repository;\n- for `gate1_doubtful` and `router_train_dm_sample`, run `python3 extension/scrip